 "line_starts_vs_grid": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "text": "2400多年前，中国就有\"冰箱\"了。 / 可它自己，[不会冷]。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": -0.123,
   "grid_bar": -1,
   "beat": 4,
   "delta": -0.123
  },
  {
   "start": 4.25,
   "text": "它的冷，是冬天凿下的冰，",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 4.406,
   "grid_bar": 1,
   "beat": 4,
   "delta": 0.156
  },
  {
   "start": 7.0,
   "text": "从冬天，一直撑到夏天。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 7.236,
   "grid_bar": 3,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": 0.236
  },
  {
   "start": 12.5,
   "text": "二之日凿冰冲冲，三之日纳于凌阴。 / {寒冬凿冰，藏进冰窖}",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 12.33,
   "grid_bar": 5,
   "beat": 2,
   "delta": -0.17
  },
  {
   "start": 16.75,
   "text": "还设了专管冰的官， / 手下光干活的，就有80人。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 16.859,
   "grid_bar": 7,
   "beat": 2,
   "delta": 0.109
  },
  {
   "start": 21.0,
   "text": "凿冰，要备足[三倍]的量。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 20.821,
   "grid_bar": 9,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": -0.179
  },
  {
   "start": 23.5,
   "text": "考古真挖到过：秦国的地下冰窖。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 23.651,
   "grid_bar": 10,
   "beat": 2,
   "delta": 0.151
  },
  {
   "start": 26.5,
   "text": "战国早期，开头那件\"冰箱\"登场。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 26.482,
   "grid_bar": 11,
   "beat": 3,
   "delta": -0.018
  },
  {
   "start": 29.5,
   "text": "方形铜盆里，套着一只方罐，",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 29.312,
   "grid_bar": 12,
   "beat": 4,
   "delta": -0.188
  },
  {
   "start": 32.25,
   "text": "冰，就塞在盆和罐的中间。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 32.142,
   "grid_bar": 14,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": -0.108
  },
  {
   "start": 37.25,
   "text": "罐里装的，是[酒]。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 37.236,
   "grid_bar": 16,
   "beat": 2,
   "delta": -0.014
  },
  {
   "start": 39.25,
   "text": "到了冬天，它还能[温]酒。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 39.501,
   "grid_bar": 17,
   "beat": 2,
   "delta": 0.251
  },
  {
   "start": 41.75,
   "text": "这么费劲的冰， / 只有朝廷和达官显贵用得起。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 41.765,
   "grid_bar": 18,
   "beat": 2,
   "delta": 0.015
  },
  {
   "start": 45.75,
   "text": "取大冰，使匠琢为山。 / {唐朝权贵：让工匠把大冰雕成山}",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 45.727,
   "grid_bar": 20,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": -0.023
  },
  {
   "start": 50.0,
   "text": "能吃的叫\"酥山\"：乳酥淋成小山，",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 50.256,
   "grid_bar": 22,
   "beat": 1,
   "delta": 0.256
  },
  {
   "start": 53.0,
   "text": "进冰窖冻好，有点像[冰淇淋]。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 53.086,
   "grid_bar": 23,
   "beat": 2,
   "delta": 0.086
  },
  {
   "start": 55.75,
   "text": "到了北宋，冰上了街： / 汴京六月，青布伞下卖\"冰雪\"。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 55.916,
   "grid_bar": 24,
   "beat": 3,
   "delta": 0.166
  },
  {
   "start": 60.0,
   "text": "卖得最好的两家，全用[银器]。",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 59.878,
   "grid_bar": 26,
   "beat": 2,
   "delta": -0.122
  },
  {
   "start": 62.75,
   "text": "于夜内凿之，声如錾石。 / {清朝北京：夜里凿冰，声音像凿石头}",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 62.709,
   "grid_bar": 27,
   "beat": 3,
   "delta": -0.041
  },
  {
   "start": 67.25,
   "text": "清宫冰窖建在半地下，墙厚两米，",
   "grid": "A",
   "nearest_beat": 67.237,
   "grid_bar": 29,
   "beat": 3,
   "delta": -0.013
  },
  {
